# The image patchy's coding agent runs in for this repository: an immutable
# tag that the trusted agent publisher (.github/workflows/publish-agent.yml)
# pushes from <% .Branch %>, built from .patchy/Dockerfile.
#
# To change the toolchain, edit .patchy/Dockerfile and bump the tag below
# (toolchain-v2, toolchain-v3, ...) in the same commit: tags are immutable,
# so a changed image at a published tag fails to publish. The publisher
# reads the tag from this file, so keep it to this one image line.
image: <% .AgentImage %>
